{"3715250": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Ozymandias: Last Strive", "steam_appid": 3715250, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will humanity thrive or will everything turn to decay by the shape of their sins and the weight of their desires?.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a great war where they refused to take part, humanity wants to use the blessing given to them by chance, and obliterate all the ancient civilizations wich came before them, now all hurt and debilitated. Will this timing be enough or are they underestimating the ancient knowldge and power they left behing and have now forgotten.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carry the aspirations of humanity in this fast paced combat focused game.                        Learn to use the soul binding system to maximaze  your combat proficiency.                Discover every hidden place in a world where you'll find optional enemies and gems awaiting for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715250/extras/aae6de1181817899d6a370fcaf263e69.avif?t=1779245904\" width=800 height=430 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play a different game look with the Soul Seeker mode!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715250/extras/6f0ba4bdab8c6edded26032e4cc481e4.avif?t=1779245904\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715250/extras_big/6f0ba4bdab8c6edded26032e4cc481e4.webp?t=1779245904 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Love BRD!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wi